Usage of mcp:
  -allow-control
    	register the selected profile's explicit run or delivery mutations
  -canonical-names
    	advertise the versioned verb_object naming preview instead of legacy names
  -profile string
    	tool inventory: legacy, inspection, execution or delivery (default "legacy")
  -runs value
    	directory whose subdirectories are runs (repeatable)
  -workspace string
    	Git repository for review_list and base for relative plan paths (default ".")
